### The Inpage Navigation Grid can be used flexibly and is often used on entry pages to better guide the end user into categories.

| **Properties/Variants** breakpoint  color on light background on dark background on bright background is sale true/false node background color alignment left center auto (refers to even spacing of the nodes) optional headings true/false | Find [design examples and themes here](https://www.figma.com/design/92moLelAY8lh8mI0rhCGzy/laioutr-UI?node-id=9131-104078&t=WGKlkG3l0TsCUryI-4) ![](blob:https://media.staging.atl-paas.net/?type=file&localId=null&id=ab44d855-e170-47d9-8a0d-ea718d01c11a&&collection=&height=816&occurrenceKey=null&width=916&__contextId=null&__displayType=null&__external=false&__fileMimeType=null&__fileName=null&__fileSize=null&__mediaTraceId=null&url=null) ![](blob:https://media.staging.atl-paas.net/?type=file&localId=null&id=44036f2b-1070-4a20-8199-184e2548bfdf&&collection=&height=530&occurrenceKey=null&width=206&__contextId=null&__displayType=null&__external=false&__fileMimeType=null&__fileName=null&__fileSize=null&__mediaTraceId=null&url=null)  |
