## **Testing (stories):**

* Grid on light background - alignment left - header - subline 
* Grid on dark background - alignment center 
* Grid on bright background - alignment left - showmore
* Grid on light background - alignment center - flaged nodes

## **Technical details**:

_**organism/InpageNavigationBasicGrid**_

```
const InpageNavigationBasicGrid {
  colorMode: 'on-light' | 'on-dark' | 'on-bright';

  categoryNodesBasic : categoryNodeBasicProps[];

  Header? : string;

  subline? : string;

  alignment : 'left' | 'center' | 'auto'

  showMoreLink? : {
    link : string;
    text : string;
  }
}
```

‌

* showMoreLink will add extra node to the list at the end 
* components will be used `LuiText` , `CategoryNodeBasic`
